# Note: a missing /assets/* file falls through to the SPA rule and is answered
# with index.html at status 200, so a chunk requested in the few seconds around
# a deploy activation comes back as HTML. It cannot be excluded here —
# _redirects supports 200/301/302/303/307/308, not 404, and there is no negative
# match. Measured: it self-heals within ~10s. The client side is what protects
# the user: lazyView() in App.tsx retries the import, then reloads once, which
# rebuilds the module map that keeps a failed chunk failed for the document.

# SPA fallback: serve the app for clean paths (/deck, /insight, /analyze).
# Real files (assets/*, og-cover.png, robots.txt, sitemap.xml) are served before this.
